legacy_caseta_button_event.description:
Lutron Connect keypads now fire `{new_event}`. They no longer fire `{old_event}`, and this site has no Lutron Caseta bridge that fires it, so these automations will not run on a keypad press:

{automations}

Open each automation in Ctrlable Pro and change its event trigger from `{old_event}` to `{new_event}`. The event data is unchanged, so nothing else needs editing. This notice clears after the next restart once no automation uses the old event.
